{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV16rejectionReportsScSyAA15RejectionReportVGvp","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"rejectionReports","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L214"},"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","text":"RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"constraintViolation()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before anything else, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracker has finished. A ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","isActive":true},{"text":" tracker’s is empty.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports"]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/rejectionReports":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","title":"rejectionReports","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "}